{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47385","headline":"题鸿都观 · 杜光庭","name":"题鸿都观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亡吴霸越已功全，深隐云林始学仙。\n鸾鹤自飘三蜀驾，波涛犹忆五湖船。\n双溪夜月明寒玉，衆岭秋空歛翠烟。\n也有扁舟归去兴，故乡东望思悠然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}